/Title (Conclusion GOT - Game of Thrones 2025 successfully achieved its objectives of promoting sports culture, encouraging healthy competition, and providing a memorable experience for all participants and spectators. The event reinforced the importance of physical fitness, teamwork, and sportsmanship among the student community. The diverse range of events ensured inclusive participation while maintaining competitive standards. The sports fest not only celebrated athletic achievement but also strengthened bonds within the college community and with other institutions. RCC Institute of Information Technology looks forward to continuing this sporting tradition and raising the bar even higher in future editions. Acknowledgments The Sports Committee extends sincere gratitude to the college administration, faculty members, student volunteers, participating institutions, and all athletes who made GOT - Game of Thrones 2025 a resounding success. Special appreciation goes to the organizing team whose tireless efforts ensured seamless event execution and to the spectators whose enthusiastic support created an unforgettable atmosphere.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 60 0 R
>>
