/E (The RCC Institute of Information Technology proudly hosted its annual inter-college sports extravaganza, "GOT - Game of Thrones," a highly anticipated sporting event that has become a hallmark of athletic excellence and competitive spirit. This year's edition brought together passionate athletes from across institutions to compete in a diverse array of sporting events, showcasing exceptional talent, teamwork, and sportsmanship. The event featured eight major sporting disciplines, attracting widespread participation and enthusiastic spectator engagement.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
