/T (Badminton The badminton competition featured both singles and doubles categories, attracting shuttle enthusiasts with varying skill levels. Players demonstrated exceptional footwork, deceptive shots, and strategic court positioning. The fast-paced rallies and dramatic comebacks made for thrilling viewing. Singles matches tested individual endurance, technique, and mental fortitude, while doubles events emphasized coordination and complementary playing styles. The use of drop shots, smashes, and defensive clears showcased the technical sophistication of the participants. Several matches went to three sets, highlighting the competitive balance and determination of the athletes. The badminton tournament maintained high standards of officiating and sportsmanship throughout. ust speed and endurance to celebrate strength-based events)
