/T (Shot Put The shot put event brought the power and technique aspects of athletics to the forefront. This field event requires a unique combination of explosive strength, proper technique, and body coordination. Participants demonstrated impressive throwing techniques, utilizing both glide and spin methods to maximize distance. Each athlete was given multiple attempts, with their best throw counting toward final rankings. The event attracted considerable attention as spectators appreciated the raw power and technical precision required for success. Athletes displayed proper warm-up routines and safety awareness, adhering to competition guidelines. The shot put competition highlighted the diversity of athletic disciplines within the sports fest, moving beyond just speed and endurance to celebrate strength-based events)
/E (Shot Put The shot put event brought the power and technique aspects of athletics to the forefront. This field event requires a unique combination of explosive strength, proper technique, and body coordination. Participants demonstrated impressive throwing techniques, utilizing both glide and spin methods to maximize distance. Each athlete was given multiple attempts, with their best throw counting toward final rankings. The event attracted considerable attention as spectators appreciated the raw power and technical precision required for success. Athletes displayed proper warm-up routines and safety awareness, adhering to competition guidelines. The shot put competition highlighted the diversity of athletic disciplines within the sports fest, moving beyond just speed and endurance to celebrate strength-based events)
