/T (Participation and Engagement The sports fest witnessed enthusiastic participation from students across all departments of RCC Institute of Information Technology as well as from visiting institutions. The diversity of events ensured that students with varying athletic abilities and interests found suitable platforms to compete. Beyond the athletes, numerous students contributed as volunteers, organizers, scorekeepers, and cheerleaders, making the event a true community effort. Organization and Infrastructure The successful execution of GOT was made possible through meticulous planning and coordination by the SWC Committee, faculty advisors, and student volunteers. Adequate sporting infrastructure, including playing fields, courts, and equipment, was made available. Safety protocols were strictly followed, with medical assistance on standby throughout the event duration. Proper scheduling ensured smooth transitions between events and minimized delays.)
/E (Participation and Engagement The sports fest witnessed enthusiastic participation from students across all departments of RCC Institute of Information Technology as well as from visiting institutions. The diversity of events ensured that students with varying athletic abilities and interests found suitable platforms to compete. Beyond the athletes, numerous students contributed as volunteers, organizers, scorekeepers, and cheerleaders, making the event a true community effort. Organization and Infrastructure The successful execution of GOT was made possible through meticulous planning and coordination by the SWC Committee, faculty advisors, and student volunteers. Adequate sporting infrastructure, including playing fields, courts, and equipment, was made available. Safety protocols were strictly followed, with medical assistance on standby throughout the event duration. Proper scheduling ensured smooth transitions between events and minimized delays.)
