/Title (Cricket Cricket, often regarded as a religion in India, lived up to its reputation during GOT. The cricket tournament featured both batting and bowling excellence, with several outstanding individual performances complementing strong team efforts. Batsmen displayed elegant strokeplay and aggressive hitting, while bowlers showcased variations in pace and spin. The matches were conducted in limited-overs format, ensuring action-packed encounters. Fielding standards remained high throughout the tournament, with spectacular catches and run-outs adding to the excitement. The spirit of cricket was evident in every match, with players respecting umpiring decisions and maintaining sporting conduct. Athletics The athletics events formed the backbone of the sports fest, featuring a wide spectrum of track and field competitions. Sprint events \(100m, 200m, 400m\) tested speed and explosive power, while middle and long-distance races evaluated endurance and pacing strategies. Relay races added an element of team coordination to individual athletic excellence. The track events witnessed several close finishes and impressive timings, with athletes pushing their physical limits. Participants trained rigorously for these events, and their dedication was evident in the competitive performances. The athletics segment attracted participants of all skill levels, promoting inclusive participation while celebrating elite performance.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 59 0 R
/Next 116 0 R
>>
